,"assignees":[{"login":"andrei-mart","id":1223507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart","html_url":"https://github.com/andrei-mart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-10-18T09:10:57Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T21:55:39Z","closed_at":"2025-03-30T21:55:39Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-13426](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-13426)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nWith value `yb_enable_expression_pushdown` set to `on` \r\n\r\nthis test case \r\n\r\n```\r\ncreate table test (a bigint, b bigint);\r\ninsert into test (a, b)\r\nselect i, 2024000000000 + i\r\nfrom generate_series(1, 100000) as i;\r\n```\r\n\r\nreturns the max of A instead of the max of B \r\n\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# select max(sub.b) from (select\r\nyugabyte(# b from test\r\nyugabyte(# where (\r\nyugabyte(# b > 2024000000000 AND\r\nyugabyte(# b < 2025000000000\r\nyugabyte(# )\r\nyugabyte(# OFFSET 0 ) as sub\r\nyugabyte-# ;\r\n  max   \r\n--------\r\n 100000\r\n(1 row)\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# insert into test values(100002,2024000100001) ;\r\nINSERT 0 1\r\nyugabyte=# select max(sub.b) from (select\r\nyugabyte(# b from test\r\nyugabyte(# where (\r\nyugabyte(# b > 2024000000000 AND\r\nyugabyte(# b < 2025000000000\r\nyugabyte(# )\r\nyugabyte(# OFFSET 0 ) as sub\r\nyugabyte-# ;\r\n  max   \r\n--------\r\n 100002\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\nyugabyte=# select count(*) from test ;\r\n count  \r\n--------\r\n 100001\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\nyugabyte=# select max(a),max(b) from test  ;\r\n  max   |      max      \r\n--------+---------------\r\n 100002 | 2024000100001\r\n(1 row)\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlthough not good practice SQL to use OFFSET like this, workarounds are available \r\n\r\n**Workarounds**\r\n\r\n(1)\r\nDisabling expression pushdown returns correct result\r\n`set yb_enable_expression_pushdown to off;`\r\n(2)\r\nUsing `ORDER BY` semantics return correct result \r\n```\r\nselect max(sub.b) from (select\r\nb from test\r\nwhere (\r\nb > 2024000000000 AND\r\nb < 2025000000000\r\n)\r\nORDER BY B OFFSET 0 ) as sub\r\n;\r\n      max      \r\n---------------\r\n 2024000100000\r\n(1 row)\r\n```\r\n(3)\r\nDont use OFFSET 0\r\n\r\n### Issue Type\r\n\r\nkind/bug\r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-13426]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-13426?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"sushantrmishra","id":7229015,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjkwMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7229015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra","html_url":"https://github.com/sushantrmishra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/24512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/24512/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}